      "rationale": "Reject this fitted relation as a generalizable identity: replay over 120 saved observations gives 29/120 within 1% relative error, 103/120 within 5%, median error 2.00% and max error 38.60%. The report's 18-point validation R2=0.999956 does not meet the workflow's 95% / 1% formula standard. In the same rows Tencent [10] equals both TDX bid1_vol and ELTDX buy_levels[0].volume in 120/120 cases; public ELTDX docs define that volume as buy-order quantity in hands. This rejects the fitted formula candidate, not every possible temporal relation; Tencent [10]'s source field remains formally unverified.",
